{"availability":"available","full":"exogee-technology/graphweaver","name":"graphweaver","description":"Turn multiple data sources into a single GraphQL API","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":556,"forks":31,"created":"2022-08-22T05:09:08Z","updated":"2026-10-08T05:17:45Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://graphweaver.com","topics":[],"demo":"https://demo.graphweaver.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:01:57.354Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T13:01:57.354Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T13:01:57.354Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:57.795Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Node.js","url":"https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome-nodejs"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T06:35:57.795Z","stars":556,"forks":31},{"at":"2026-10-10T13:01:57.354Z","stars":556,"forks":31}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The code-first, MAXIMALLY CUSTOMISABLE open source alternative to Hasura that is easy to self host.","Graphweaver speeds up your GraphQL development by securely connecting all your data sources in one place. Once your API has been bootstrapped, you can add permissions / auth and completely customise every operation in your server. We offer in-built resolvers for all common data access scenarios, but give you full flexibility to override them however you like! You also get an admin area that you can customise so that you don't have to build a back office system ever again.","We consistently find that everyone has lots of sources of truth. You know, CRM holding customer data, accounting systems handling invoices, and more scattered across different SaaS platforms and databases? It's a real pain to sync it all up!"],"features":["Instant GraphQL API - Instant CRUD API from any data source","Granular Permissions - Row and column-level security","Multiple Data Sources - Combine multiple data sources (Postgres, Mysql, SQLite, Saas Platforms, REST)","Cross Source Filters - Graphweaver allows you to filter across data sources, from one database by another","100% Open Source - Available on GitHub under the MIT license, so you are free to change and deploy as needed."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/exogee-technology/graphweaver/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7bf2556b289813cd173ccc44f88b8e02845d6c891404fb41e04dccfbcab0dafa","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:57.795Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:57.795Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The code-first, MAXIMALLY CUSTOMISABLE open source alternative to Hasura that is easy to self host.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/exogee-technology/graphweaver/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The code-first, MAXIMALLY CUSTOMISABLE open source alternative to Hasura that is easy to self host.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/exogee-technology/graphweaver/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Start quickly, use the default for most things, change whatever you like, self-host, and never lose control.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/exogee-technology/graphweaver/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"7bf2556b289813cd173ccc44f88b8e02845d6c891404fb41e04dccfbcab0dafa","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/exogee-technology/graphweaver/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:57.795Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T05:17:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/exogee-technology/graphweaver/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:57.795Z","hash":"7bf2556b289813cd173ccc44f88b8e02845d6c891404fb41e04dccfbcab0dafa","originalBytes":9669,"storedBytes":9669,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","graphweaver","new","security","source","create","install","api","pnpm","start","access","documentation","release","database","features","license","need","run","sources","which","across","admin","graph